W:In English:
W:(The line) Let us through, let us through, you bridge-master!
W:(The gate) I won't let you through, I won't, you bridge-master!
W:(All) Crawl, crawl, little green one, with your green leaves; the golden gate is open, just crawl through it, through, through, through...
